  "prompt": "For each order that a customer with customer_id from 3001 to 3100 (both included) placed from 1 January to 30 June 2025 (order_ts holds UTC time; both days included, in UTC), show how many days passed since the same customer's previous order in that period: the UTC date of the order minus the UTC date of the previous order. A customer's orders follow each other by order_ts; when two orders share a moment, the lower order_id comes first. A customer's first order in the period shows days_since_prev as missing. Return order_id, customer_id, order_ts and days_since_prev. Any row order is fine.",
